==English==

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*wekʷ-}}
Borrowed from {{bor|en|frm|convoquer}}, from {{der|en|la|convocare}}, from {{m|la|con-||with}} + {{m|la|vocō||to call}}. {{doublet|en|convocate}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/kənˈvoʊk/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-convoke.wav|a=Southern England}}
* {{rhymes|en|əʊk|s=2}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[convene]], to [[cause]] to [[assemble]] for a [[meeting]].
# To call together.

